Thai Waters Rev F | charge_cv_knee
* 4.185 V equivalent cell OCV and 100 mOhm cell resistance.
* Model: Ideal 300 mA / 4.2 V charge law with 0.10 ohm CV slope. Demonstrates programmed boundaries; excludes device accuracy, precharge, termination and autonomous POR.
Vcell ocv 0 4.185
Rcell bat ocv 0.1
Vsense source bat 0
* x=(4.2-Vbat)/0.1, positive-voltage error over these cases only.
Gcc 0 source VALUE={0.5*(0.3+(4.2-V(bat))/0.1-ABS(0.3-(4.2-V(bat))/0.1))}
.TRAN 1u 10u
.PRINT TRAN V(bat) I(Vsense)
.END
